      "message": "`dut-control ec_uart_regexp:\"\u003cregex\u003e\"` can be used to automatically query the EC output for a regular expression.\n\nThis example captures the digits following the `power state ` text output:\n```\n$dut_control ec_uart_regexp:\"[\u0027power state (\\d+)\u0027]\"\n$dut_control ec_uart_cmd:\u0027powerinfo\u0027\nlocal result\u003d$($dut_control ec_uart_cmd)\n```\n\nThe result creates a string of tuples designated by square brackets.\n\nRun these commands manually to see the exact output format.",
